infinite-patch 1
# Karplus Sympathetic Bowed Monochord Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.5
  i steps 16
  i note0 45
  i note1 52
  i note2 49
  i note3 57
  i note4 45
  i note5 50
  i note6 54
  i note7 52
  i note8 45
  i note9 47
  i note10 49
  i note11 52
  i note12 45
